WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,860
Sister, the west, south, and north are all cleared.

2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:08,460
Bring everything with you. Make a floor on the first floor and leave tomorrow morning.

3
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:12,490
There is another nest in the basement holding things and pressing people down, taking turns.

4
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:20,270
Put him down. I have something to ask him.

5
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:31,130
Dawn, are you willing to join my team and be my subordinate?

6
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:32,350
Where are they?

7
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:34,150
I also want these ones you have

8
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:37,650
But I won’t follow you. I’ll be assigned to the alliance column according to ability.

9
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:40,950
Brother Ming, I'm sorry. I'm also a space user.

10
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:44,080
I didn't believe anyone before, so I kept it hidden

11
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:47,080
I stole the few supplies in the base. I'm sorry.
